---
/**
 * The chip "fylls i": marks a fact the association has not given yet, instead of making one up.
 * Say what is missing in the slot, e.g. "nummer fylls i". Works on cotton and, inside `.on-green`, on green.
 * Follows `sl-todo` in the design system's Placeholder component.
 */
---

<span class="fylls-i"><slot>fylls i</slot></span>

<style>
  .fylls-i {
    display: inline-block;
    border: 2px dashed var(--color-ink);
    padding: 2px 10px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    background: rgba(251, 251, 248, 0.45);
  }
  :global(.on-green) .fylls-i {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-cotton);
    border-color: var(--color-mint);
  }
</style>
